      "name": "Stand Still",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature within the kerulkagon's reach uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using\n\n---\nEffect The kerulkagon makes a melee Strike against the triggering creature. If the attack is a critical hit, the action is disrupted."
