    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Personal Portal",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "teleportation"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The kerulkagon teleports to an unoccupied space it can see within 30 feet.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Portal Throw",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "attack",
        "manipulate",
        "teleportation"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements The kerulkagon has a creature Grabbed or Restrained\n\n---\nEffect The kerulkagon creates a portal and attempts to throw the required creature through it. The kerulkagon attempts an Athletics check check against the Fortitude DC of the creature it has grabbed or restrained.\n\n---\nCritical Success The kerulkagon hurls the target through the portal. The target is teleported violently to a location with 100 feet that the kerulkagon can see, dealing 12d10 bludgeoning damage to the target and knocking it Prone on impact.\n\nSuccess As critical success, but the target takes only 6d10 bludgeoning damage.\n\nFailure The kerulkagon fails to throw the creature.\n\nCritical Failure As failure, but the creature is no longer grabbed or restrained."
    },
